    title: "python.yaml's stdlib_modules is a 3.12 snapshot: distutils/imp/asyncore/smtpd/binhex (stdlib on 3.10/3.11) read as non-stdlib, cgi/telnetlib (gone in 3.13) as stdlib; the safe direction needs an owner ruling"  # e888
